{"id":"hilflos","lemma":"hilflos","pos":"adv","rank":3905,"glosses":["helplessly"],"ipa":"/ˈhɪlfloːs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/26/De-hilflos.ogg/De-hilflos.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir waren alle hilflos.","en":"We were all helpless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/694926","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"all, everyone"},null]},{"text":"Ohne ihn wäre ich hilflos.","en":"Without him, I would be helpless.","words":[{"g":"without"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Ich komme mir hilflos vor.","en":"I feel helpless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389522","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"in front of, ahead of"}]},{"text":"Ich bin nicht gerade hilflos.","en":"I'm not helpless, you know.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"now"},null]},{"text":"Ich fühlte mich so hilflos.","en":"I felt so helpless.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"fühlen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"so"},null]}]}